---
title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Recovery
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Breaks BoundOwnSource
    lg3: Path to the BoundOwnSource or CodexFirstInputDelivered bug
    lg4: Repeats forever, so CodexFirstInputDelivered breaks
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  class lg4 repeats
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: Creating, a message waiting
  s3: Created, location not yet recorded, a message waiting
  s4: Pane recorded, only a shell, a message waiting
  s5: dcserver down, nothing running, a message waiting
  s6: Pane recorded, provider up, no prompt yet, a message waiting
  s7: Boot reconcile, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s8: Boot reconcile, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s9: Bound without its source, a message waiting
  s10: Pending, no pane recorded, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s11: No session, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s12: No session, host server replaced, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s13: Creating, host server replaced, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s14: Created, location not yet recorded, host server replaced, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s15: Pane recorded, only a shell, host server replaced, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s16: Pane recorded, only a shell, host server replaced (after the restart)
  s17: Pane recorded, provider up, no prompt yet, host server replaced, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s18: Bound without its source, host server replaced, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s19: Bound without its source, host server replaced, a message waiting (after the restart), cancel pending
  s20: Bound without its source, host server replaced (after the restart), cancel pending (no more messages)
  s21: Bound without its source, host server replaced (after the restart), cancel delivered (no more messages)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a host probe stops failing or tmux becomes usable
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s3: the host creates it
  s3 --> s4: its pane is recorded
  s2 --> s5: dcserver stops
  s4 --> s6: the provider starts in the pane
  s5 --> s7: dcserver starts
  s6 --> s6: a host probe stops failing
  s7 --> s8: the host server ends
  s6 --> s9: the recorded pane's provider is adopted
  s8 --> s10: intake opens
  s10 --> s11: the census finds nothing and closes the row
  s11 --> s12: the host server starts again
  s12 --> s13: a message reserves a new execution
  s13 --> s14: the host creates it
  s14 --> s15: its pane is recorded
  s15 --> s16: the turn is refused: no provider, or its first prompt already taken
  s16 --> s15: a message arrives
  s15 --> s17: the provider starts in the pane
  s17 --> s18: the recorded pane's provider is adopted
  s18 --> s19: a cancel is requested
  s19 --> s20: the next prompt is refused: no source
  s20 --> s21: the cancel is delivered or dropped
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
